<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts Shiloh.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts Shiloh.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it started coverage of Shiloh Industries Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up one to 17-1/4.</p>
